    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41710" root="وجز" body-key="w">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">توجّز الشّءَ</span></b>  <i>He sought, asked,</i> or <i>demanded,
the accomplishment of the thing;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنَجَّزَهُ</span>:
(S, K:) <i>he sought, asked,</i> or <i>demanded, it;</i> syn.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلْتَمَسَهُ</span>; (K;) <i>and asked for its accomplishment;</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنجّزه</span> meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِلْتَمَسَهُ وَسَأَلَ نَجَازَهُ</span>. (TA.)

